                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i0">
                     <locus from="1v" to="14v">1v-14v</locus>
                     <textLang xml:lang="ar">Arabic</textLang>
                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s36IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>سورة الملك ثلىون ايات مكىه \ بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم \ بترك الذي بيده الملك وهو على كل شئ قدير</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#14v">-14v</locus>ويل يومئد للمكدبين فباى حديث بعده يؤمنون</explicit>
                     <note>67:1-77:11. Order of the folios disrupted. Titles of suras rubricated. Triple dots as verse markers on some folios, on others red circles with a dot in the middle. Ǧuz' marker in red on fol. 1v, in the margin. Ḥizb marker in red on fol. 12r, in the margin. Ihmāl marks (kāf-s). Extensions of letters into the margin (in particular mīm). Several words left incomplete at the end of a line, without diacritics or vocalization, and written in full on the following line. Some words completed on the following line. Deletions including words in the titles of suras. Corrections in the margins and between the lines by another hand using  pale ink. Catchwords from another hand, some deleted.</note>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
